{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEG is a pure puzzle Metroidvania game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All puzzles in the game are pure logic-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing you can do is click cells and use logical reasoning to complete various puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 50 puzzle types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Over 600 unique handcrafted puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich note-taking system to facilitate reasoning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No language required, accessible to players worldwide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- More than 20 relaxing and atmospheric music tracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimalistic hand-drawn art style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Left Mouse Button: Fill cell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Middle Mouse Button: Drag map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mouse Wheel: Zoom map</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Right Mouse Button: Mark cell</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- R Key: Reset puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shift+Right Mouse: Draw notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Shift+Left Click Cell: Instantly complete puzzles already finished in another save file</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ctrl+Right Mouse: Select notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- X Key: Delete all or selected notes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Z Key: Undo note operation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Y Key: Redo note operation</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1760081466","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4044990?t=1760081466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4044990/7961e28d96ec7a9883ba9a11a9bdb45509df97f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760081466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/